/assets/
# AIGC 检测 reference 语料（104 本版权书，I11 合规边界）：正文绝不入 git；catalog.json 元数据可进
datasets/aigc-detection/books/
datasets/aigc-detection/converted/
server/agent/variables/generated-profile-variable-types.d.ts
# 基准测试的原始结果：带本机 CPU 型号、内存、OS build 和绝对路径，只保留同目录 .md 摘要
**/benchmarks/results/*.json
# Crash dumps
*.stackdump
# Test output
test-results/
# Agent session / workspace runtime data (server-side)
server/workspace/.nbook/
server/.agent/
